Z||000000||JohnnyK||02-05-2001||02:42 PM||||I just got my car back from being certified to sell, and it has a few problems. Well, two. All the rotors are gone (I think I might actually have 2 in my garage!) But he says there is movement in the 2 front a-arms (you can actually move the pin or something like that). I just replaced the bushings a few months ago? Any ideas what could cause this?||||reg||1
