Z||000002||Tigger||02-06-2001||12:09 PM||||I'd tend to say worn ball joints or even tie rod ends would cause the movement.  That's if bushings are fairly new.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Coop88||02-06-2001||11:31 PM||||My upper control arm(driver's side) moved side to side on my formula. It was a loose bolt. The bolt was one of two that held down the round shaft that the control arm pivots on. Hope this helped.||||reg||10
